<title>UK: Hanson sells landfills to Shanks &amp; McEwan.</title>
<headline>Hanson sells landfills to Shanks &amp; McEwan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British industrial management group Hanson Plc said on Thursday Hanson Properties sold the freehold of five landfill sites to Shanks &amp; McEwan Group Plc for 32 million pounds.</p>
<p>Hanson said Shanks &amp; McEwan currently leased the sites. It said that, as part of the transaction, Shanks &amp; McEwan has relinquished options and pre-emption rights over other Hanson potential landfill sites and properties.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4107</p>
